      <p class="legend-text">
        If you roll <strong>double 1’s</strong> (snake eyes 🐍), you lose your **entire score** — everything you earned so far.  
        Risk and luck walk hand in hand!
      </p>

      <p class="legend-text">
        You can stop at any time and “<strong>Hold</strong>” — which saves your current turn’s score and passes the dice to the next player.
      </p>

      <blockquote class="border-start border-3 border-danger ps-3 fst-italic text-secondary">
        “Smart players know when to roll... and when to hold.”
      </blockquote>

      <p class="legend-text">
        Whether you’re facing a friend, a computer, or fate itself —  
        remember: every roll is a chance, and every chance is a story.  
        Play boldly, laugh loudly, and never fear the number one.
      </p>

      <p class="legend-title fst-italic fw-bold">Ready? Tap <strong>ROLL</strong> — and let the game begin!</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
